{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/2821183/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/2821183/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちに、新しい観葉植物が仲間入りしたよ(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/2821183/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンセベリアちゃんです ＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/2821183/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイナスイオン効果が高くて、空気をキレイにしてくれるらしいです！◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンセベリアちゃん実家でも育ててたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きくて持ってくるのが大変なので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またこっちでも購入しちゃいました(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり植物は癒されますね～( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/2821183/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/2821183/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/2821183/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、番組を見てくださった方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難う御座います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送でも言いましたが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"支えてくれる皆さんのことを思うと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やはり嬉しい気持ちもあるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現状には申し訳ないとか悔しいなって思ってしまいます..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、あまり深く色々気にしてはいません(^_^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって、辛くなったとき、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"両親に会いたくなったりしたけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな大切な両親のことを考えると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと、お父さんとお母さんは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が辛くて苦しくて泣いているのを見たいんじゃなくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔でお仕事頑張ってる姿を見たいんだろうなって思ったから...( ´^_^` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くよくよするより、前を向いて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔で楽しもうと思いました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまりポジションとかそういうもを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私自身、言い訳にしたくはありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな場面だって、一生懸命頑張ってたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと伝わることがあるはずです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが例え、一秒でも、一瞬だとしても、必ずあるはずです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、どんなポジションだって、どんなお仕事だって、一生懸命笑顔で頑張る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決して、現状に満足している訳ではないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不満足という表現とは、違うような気がします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は、お仕事することがすごく楽しいし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲間といる時間が大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、幸せです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに、応援してくれる人がいて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"支えてくれる人がいて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に喜んでくれる人がいて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に涙を流してくれる人がいて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切な家族もいて、友達もいて、仲間もいて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに温かくて、幸せなことはないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛くても、それは夢を追いかけるための辛さだから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は幸せものだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直、時々すごくこわくなります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても こわい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１７年間生きてきて、今まで感じたこともないような感情が溢れたりして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくわからなくなったりします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が自分じゃないような。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この世界に入るまで、こんなに苦しくて複雑な気持ち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感じたことなかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私には、誰かのせいにしたり、責めたりなんてできない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも自分を責めて、すべて自分で背負って溜め込んで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分だけでなんとかしようとしても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上手にできなくて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰も傷付けたくなくて、自分をいっぱい傷付けました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそれは間違ってたなって...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とくに、パルコ公演では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"支え合うことの大切さを知りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂は、みんな良い子だから、自分を責めちゃうんですよね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなそれぞれ、色んなものを抱えて生きているんだね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人は一人では生きていけないことを知りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、人は一人じゃないと..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は一人で生きてるんじゃないと、知りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなに頑張っても、報われないかもっていう恐怖心はあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、だからといって、頑張りたいって気持ちを失いたくはないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうって、感謝の気持ちも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、優しいだけの私じゃないよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強くなるんだ(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強くね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しいという字は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人偏に、憂うると書きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人を憂うる、人の淋しさ侘しさ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つらさがわかる人..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが本当の優しさ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つらい経験をした分、その分だけ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人は本当に、優しくなれる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが、人間として一番「  優れた人 」ということ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「優れた」は、「勝れた」とも書きますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つまり、強い人間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当の強さってやつ！( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強さは、力じゃなくて心だってヒーローが教えてくれたもん！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの寂しさやつらさをわかってあげて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの一員として、力になりたい。少しでも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の好きな、植物。○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見た目は、すごく可愛らしいけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"根っこはとっても強いんだよ（＾_＾）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/2821183/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小百合も、ユリだけに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな花のようになりたいなっ ＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/2821183/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/2821183/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/2821183/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/2821183/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"ht